/-!
# ManyBody

Root of the library for contributions made after the v1.0 foundation.
Place new modules under `ManyBody/<Sector>/`, e.g. `ManyBody/S3/HeliumMoments.lean`,
and import the trusted foundation definitions (for example `import CoulombSpectralFoundation_v3`)
instead of redefining the Hamiltonian. See CONTRIBUTING.md.
-/
